ITERAMBERE
UMUTWE WA 
MBERE:
Ubushobozi bw’ingenzi bugamijwe
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ijyanye n’iterambere, gushishikarira ibikorwa 
by’iterambere no kubishishikariza bagenzi be;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza utwatuzo mu nteruro mu gusoma no mu kwandika;
 ‒ Kwandika akoresha neza inyuguti nkuru aho bisabwa;
 ‒ Gutandukanya impuzanyito n’imbusane no kubikoresha neza mu nteruro.
Munyeshuri, nyuma y’uyu mutwe uzaba ufite ubushobozi bugaragarira mu buryo 
bukurikira: 
Ubumenyi
 ‒ Gusobanura amagambo utari usobanukiwe ari mu mwandiko;
 ‒ Gusobanura ibijyanye n’iterambere ukurikije umwandiko yasomye n’ubumenyi ufite 
ku iterambere;
 ‒ Gusobanura imikoreshereze y’utwatuzo tw’ibanze n’utwatuzo dukoreshwa hagati 
mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gusobanura imikoreshereze y’inyuguti nkuru;
 ‒ Gusobanura inyunguramagambo nk’imbusane n’impuzanyito.
Ubumenyi ngiro
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ivuga ku iterambere;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza mu nteruro amagambo wungukiye mu mwandiko;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza mu mvugo no munyandiko utwatuzo tw’ibanze n’utwatuzo 
dukoreshwa hagati mu nteruro;
 ‒ Kwandika ukoresha neza inyuguti nkuru aho bisabwa;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza amagambo mu nteruro uyasimbuza imbusane cyangwa impuzanyito 
zayo.
Ubukesha
 ‒ Gushishikarira gusoma no kwandika wubahiriza utwatuzo n’iyitsa;
 ‒ Gushishikarira ibikorwa by’iterambere no kubishishikariza bagenzi bawe;
 ‒ Kurangwa no kwandika ukoresha inyuguti nkuru aho bisabwa;
 ‒ Kurangwa no gukoresha inyunguramagambo zitandukanye mu mvugo no mu 
nyandiko.

