IMIKINO 
N’IMYIDAGADURO
UMUTWE WA 
GATANU: 
Ubushozi bw’ingenzi bugamijwe
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ijyanye n’imikino n’imyidagaduro; 
 ‒ Guhanga, kuririmba no kubyina imbyino gakondo no kubahiriza injyana zazo;
 ‒ Gufata mu mutwe amagorane no kuyavuga mu ruhame;
 ‒ Gukora neza interuro no kubahiriza isanisha.
Munyeshuri, nyuma y’uyu mutwe uzaba ufite ubushobozi bugaragarira muri ubu 
buryo bukurikira: 
Ubumenyi
 ‒ Gusobanura amagambo utari usobanukiwe ari mu mwandiko;
 ‒ Gusobanura ibijyanye bimwe mu bijyanye n’imikino n’imyidagaduro;
 ‒ Gusobanura uko bahanga indirimbo;
 ‒ Gutahura no gusobanura uko bakoresha udukubo mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gusobanura amagorane icyo ari cyo;
 ‒ Gusobanura interuro mbonezamvugo n’interuro nyobyamvugo ukoresha neza 
isanisha.
Ubumenyi ngiro
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ku guteza imbere imikino n’imyidagaduro;
 ‒ Guhanga, kuririmba no kubyina imbyino gakondo wubahiriza injyana zazo;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza mu nyandiko udukubo;
 ‒ Gufata mu mutwe no kuvuga neza amagorane;
 ‒ Kuvuga no kwandika ukoresha interuro mbonezamvugo.
Ubukesha
 ‒ Gushishikarira no gushishikariza abandi imikino n’imyidagaduro;
 ‒ Kurangwa n’umuco wo guhanga, kuririmba no kubyina imbyino gakondo wubahiriza 
injyana zazo;
 ‒ Kugira umuco wo gukoresha neza mu nyandiko udukubo n’udusodeko no kujora 
inyandiko zirimo utwatuzo dukoresheje mu buryo butanoze;
 ‒ Kurangwa no gufata mu mutwe no kuvuga neza amagorane;
 ‒ Gushishikarira no gushishikariza abandi gukoresha interuro mbonezamvugo mu 
mvugo no mu nyandiko.

