GUKUNDA NO 
KWITABIRA UMURIMO
UMUTWE WA 
GATANDATU:
Ubushobozi bw’ingenzi bugamijwe
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ivuga ku gukunda umurimo;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza utwatuzo mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gutahura inteko n’indanganteko z’amazina; 
 ‒ Kwandika neza ibaruwa mbonezamubano;
 ‒ Guhanga, gukina no kuvugira mu ruhame nta bwoba.
Munyeshuri, nyuma y’uyu mutwe uzaba ufite ubushobozi bugaragarira muri ubu 
buryo bukurikira: 
Ubumenyi
 ‒ Gusobanura amagambo utari usobanukiwe ari mu mwandiko;
 ‒ Gusobanura ibijyanye no gukunda no kwitabira umurimo uhereye ku mwandiko;
 ‒ Gusobanura uko bakoresha udusodeko mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gutahura no gusobanura inteko n’indanganteko by’amazina; 
 ‒ Gusobanura uko bandika ibaruwa mbonezamubano;
 ‒ Gusobanura inshoza y’ikinamico n’uko bahanga ikinamico; 
Ubumenyi ngiro
 ‒ Gusoma no gusesengura imyandiko ivuga ku gukunda umurimo;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza amagambo mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza udusodeko mu nteruro;
 ‒ Gukoresha neza isanisha mu wubahiriza inteko n’indanganteko by’amazina; 
 ‒ Kwandika neza ibaruwa mbonezamubano, guhanga no gukina agakinamico yigana 
abanyarubuga; 
 ‒ Guhanga no gukina ikinamico ikinamico wigana abanyarubuga bayo.
Ubukesha
 ‒ Gushishikarira no gushishikariza abandi gukunda no kwitabira umurimo;
 ‒ Kugira umuco wo gukoresha neza mu nyandiko udusodeko no kujora inyandiko 
zirimo  utwatuzo dukoresheje mu buryo butanoze;
 ‒ Gushishikarira no gushishikariza abandi gukora interuro ziboneye, zikoresheje neza 
isanisha;  
 ‒ Gushishikarira kwandika ibaruwa mbonezamubano iboneye;
 ‒ Gushishikarira guhanga no gukina ikinamico wigana abanyarubuga bayo.

