 − Gukoresha neza mu mvugo no munyandiko imvugo zikoreshwa ku masaha n’amezi bya 
kinyarwanda;
 − Gukoresha neza mu mvugo no mu nyandiko ikeshamvugo ku nka, ku mata no ku gisabo; 
 − Gukoresha neza mu mvugo no munyandiko indamukanyo za kinyarwanda.
