uburyo bwo gukoresha amagambo nk’amarangamutima, inyigana, inshinga iri mu mbundo 
ndetse n’uko wakwandika amagambo amwe n’amwe. Harimo nanone inshoza y’inkuru 
ngufi n’uturango twayo bizagufasha guhanga inkuru ngufi.

